# Scaffold record

This stamp is a **summary**, not a transcript. The full command output is
shown live at the exit gate and re-generated by scaffold-reviewer (which
re-runs the commands); the reviewer compares its fresh run against the
command names and counts below, so those must be exact.

- **Language:** python
- **Architecture tests:** `uv run pytest tests/test_architecture.py -v` → green (5 passed)
- **BDD specs:** `uv run pytest tests/ -v` → red (11 scenarios failed with `StepDefinitionNotFoundError`; the 5 architecture tests are also collected and pass)
